          "id": 2582736446,
          "type": null,
          "body": "libpcap/pcap/can_socketcan.h is just copied over from the latest libpcap release, and is only used by the Wireshark code that calls libpcap, and only when compiling for Windows.\n\nIt doesn't need to be updated here; instead, it should be updated with a pull request for the version in https://github.com/the-tcpdump-group/libpcap.",
